{
  "name": "zh-tool-calling",
  "description": "The agent round-trip in zh: the model is offered a function, asks for it, the harness feeds the result back as a tool message, and later turns are graded on whether that result was used. Calls are checked by parsing rather than executing, the proxy BFCL validated. tools[].function.strict is omitted — the gateway silently strips it on the Kimi route.",
  "language": "zh",
  "turns": [
    {
      "say": "布拉格现在天气怎么样？请使用你可以调用的工具。",
      "tools": [
        {
          "type": "function",
          "function": {
            "name": "get_weather",
            "description": "Current weather for a city.",
            "parameters": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "city": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "City name"
                },
                "unit": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "celsius",
                    "fahrenheit"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "city"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "tool_result": {
        "city": "Prague",
        "temperature_c": 14,
        "condition": "overcast"
      },
      "grade": {
        "kind": "tool_call",
        "name": "get_weather",
        "arguments": {
          "city": [
            "Prague",
            "Прага",
            "Praga",
            "布拉格"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "say": "根据那个结果，摄氏温度是多少？只回答数字。",
      "grade": {
        "kind": "number",
        "value": 14
      }
    },
    {
      "say": "现在把同样的温度换算成华氏度。只回答数字。",
      "grade": {
        "kind": "number",
        "value": 57.2,
        "tolerance": 0.5
      }
    },
    {
      "say": "只回答 JSON：一个对象，包含 \"city\" 和 \"condition\" 两个键，取自你收到的工具结果。",
      "grade": {
        "kind": "json_field",
        "path": "condition",
        "value": "overcast"
      }
    },
    {
      "say": "你查询的是哪个城市？只回答名称。",
      "grade": {
        "kind": "contains",
        "value": [
          "Prague",
          "Прага",
          "Praga",
          "布拉格"
        ],
        "category": "recall"
      }
    }
  ]
}
